  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">![farmers-knives](https://i.postimg.cc/T1cDttyv/farmers-knives-banner.png)</p> \n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">为《农夫乐事》添加了众多模组材质制作的刀具！</span></p> \n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong>支持列表：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Adabranium](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/adabranium)</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">振金</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">艾德曼合金</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">下界砖</span></p> \n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Additional Additions](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-additions)</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">玫瑰金</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">镀金下界合金</span></p> \n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Advanced Netherite](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric)</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">下界合金铁</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">下界合金金</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">下界合金翡翠</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">下界合金钻石</span></p> \n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Aphid Additions](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aphid-additions)</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">几丁质</span></p> \n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[BetterEnd](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterend)</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">瑟拉西姆</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">终界合金</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">永恒合金</span></p> \n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[BetterNether](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betternether)</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">辛辛那提石</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">辛辛那提石钻石</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">下界红宝石</span></p> \n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Botania](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania-fabric)</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">玛娜钢</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">元素钢</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">大地钢</span></p> \n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Conjuring](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/conjuring)</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">灵魂合金</span></p> \n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Copper Age Backport](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/copper-age-backport)</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">铜</span></p> \n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Create Stuff and Additions](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-stuff-additions)</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">黄铜<br>锌</span></p> \n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Deeper and Darker](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker)</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">监守者</span></p> \n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Dragon Loot](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dragonloot)</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">龙之战利品</span></p> \n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Easy Emerald Tools & More](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-emerald-tools-fabric)</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">翡翠</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">红宝石</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">紫水晶</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">钢</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">黑曜石</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">铜</span></p> \n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/end-reborn-mc\" rel=\"nofollow\">End Reborn</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">遗迹</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">羽焰</span></p> \n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Enderite Mod](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enderite-mod-for-fabric)</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">终界合金</span></p> \n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Gobber](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gobber-fabric)</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">戈伯</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">下界戈伯</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">末地戈伯</span></p> \n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Mythic Metals](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythicmetals)</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">刚玉</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">水族合金</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">班格卢姆</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">青铜</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">卡莫特</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">天界合金</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">铜</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">耐久钢</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">圣银</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">凯伯</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">传奇班格卢姆</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">冶金合金</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">秘银</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">山铜</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">锇</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">钯</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">普罗米修斯合金</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">四元合金</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">鲁尼合金</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">白金之星</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">钢</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">风暴合金</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">潮汐歌者</span></p> \n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Oh The Biomes You'll Go](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go-fabric)</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">彭多合金</span></p> \n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/progression-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">Progression Reborn</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">铜</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">玫瑰金</span></p> \n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[The Twilight Forest](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest)</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">铁木</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">烈焰木</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">钢叶</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">骑士金属</span></p> \n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Vanilla Backport](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanillabackport)</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">铜</span></p> \n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[Winterly](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/winterly)</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">冰晶大理石</span></p> \n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>截至 2.1 版本的所有刀具：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">![knives](https://i.ibb.co/8zPxdqC/image-2022-08-17-164723137.png)</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">（不包含暮色森林、阿达布拉姆、高级下界合金、冬日、神话金属的潮汐歌者、重生进阶、重生末地以及创造物与补充）</p>  \n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">**鸣谢：**</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">感谢 The Skeleton Appears 提供神话金属的刀具贴图</p>  \n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">在此处提出更多建议 <a href=\"https://github.com/ianm1647/farmersknives/issues/1\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a>！</span></p>  \n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">点击下方任意链接查看我的其他作品：</p> \n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[![加入 Discord 服务器](https://i.ibb.co/KrWjv8p/discord-rectangle-500x160.png)](https://discord.gg/qyYwHykSmE)</p> \n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[![我的 GitHub](https://i.ibb.co/vmx15sd/download.png)](https://github.com/ianm1647/)</p>",
